       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Loads ASCII line-sequential sample data into GnuCOBOL indexed files
*> (stand-in for the VSAM KSDS clusters used by POSTTRAN).
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LOADKSDS.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT XREF-IN  ASSIGN TO XREFIN  ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT ACCT-IN  ASSIGN TO ACCTIN  ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT TCAT-IN  ASSIGN TO TCATIN  ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT XREF-OUT ASSIGN TO XREFFILE ORGANIZATION INDEXED
           ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY XO-KEY.
    SELECT ACCT-OUT ASSIGN TO ACCTFILE ORGANIZATION INDEXED
           ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY AO-KEY.
    SELECT TCAT-OUT ASSIGN TO TCATBALF ORGANIZATION INDEXED
           ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY TO-KEY.
    SELECT TRAN-OUT ASSIGN TO TRANFILE ORGANIZATION INDEXED
           ACCESS SEQUENTIAL RECORD KEY TR-KEY.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD XREF-IN.  01 XI-REC PIC X(50).
FD ACCT-IN.  01 AI-REC PIC X(300).
FD TCAT-IN.  01 TI-REC PIC X(50).
FD XREF-OUT. 01 XO-REC. 05 XO-KEY PIC X(16). 05 FILLER PIC X(34).
FD ACCT-OUT. 01 AO-REC. 05 AO-KEY PIC X(11). 05 FILLER PIC X(289).
FD TCAT-OUT. 01 TO-REC. 05 TO-KEY PIC X(17). 05 FILLER PIC X(33).
FD TRAN-OUT. 01 TR-REC. 05 TR-KEY PIC X(16). 05 FILLER PIC X(334).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN INPUT XREF-IN OUTPUT XREF-OUT
    MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ XREF-IN AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END MOVE XI-REC TO XO-REC WRITE XO-REC END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE XREF-IN XREF-OUT
    OPEN INPUT ACCT-IN OUTPUT ACCT-OUT
    MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ ACCT-IN AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END MOVE AI-REC TO AO-REC WRITE AO-REC END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE ACCT-IN ACCT-OUT
    OPEN INPUT TCAT-IN OUTPUT TCAT-OUT
    MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
        READ TCAT-IN AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        NOT AT END MOVE TI-REC TO TO-REC WRITE TO-REC END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE TCAT-IN TCAT-OUT
    OPEN OUTPUT TRAN-OUT
    CLOSE TRAN-OUT
    GOBACK.
